{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05731","headline":"赠李郎中 · 杨浚","name":"赠李郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙郎早朝退，直省卧南轩。\n院竹自成赏，阶庭寂不喧。\n焚香开後阁，起草闭前门。\n礼乐风流美，光华星位尊。\n荣兼朱绂贵，交乃布衣存。\n是日登龙客，无忘君子恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨浚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}